  "notes": "Regions = leagues from docs/design/07 §5.2 plus regions without a league so that every canon national team has a country [FILLER]. Transylvania, Flanders and New Spain are treated as countries in their own right because canon presents them as national teams. school_id: Hogwarts (British Isles), Beauxbatons (France, Iberia, Italy, Flanders [inferred]), Durmstrang (Eastern Europe, Germany, Nordics [inferred: GoF suggests a northern/eastern school]), Ilvermorny (USA, Canada), Castelobruxo (all of Latin America [inferred]), Uagadou (Africa, Maghreb, Madagascar [inferred]), Mahoutokoro (Japan, China [inferred]); Oceania, Middle East and South Asia have no known canon school: null. Koldovstoretz is not used (there is no Russian region in v1)."
